{"type":"message","id":"eeab5aa3","parentId":"7f7ec129","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:16:58.593Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"MEMORY.md에 더 많은 정보가 있을 것 같습니다. 더 읽어보겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3f21478576044dcca2750fb1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -i \"model\\|personaliz\\|설정\\|alias\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md | head -30"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":1593,"output":84,"cacheRead":31903,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33580,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771579016627}}
{"type":"message","id":"5752a88a","parentId":"eeab5aa3","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:16:58.613Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3f21478576044dcca2750fb1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| #65 | 10:21 PM | 🔵 | OpenClaw 설정 파일 구조 확인 (openclaw.json) | ~241 |  |\n**../../home/lfant/.openclaw/extensions/claude-mem/.env (또는 유사 설정 파일)**\n| #66 | \" | 🔵 | claude-mem 환경변수 설정 전체 확인 | ~243 |  |\n**#S40** Change all sub-agent models to the current model (Feb 19, 8:23 AM)\n| #235 | 6:11 PM | ✅ | Sub-agent Model Unification Request | ~195 |  |\n**#S41** Sub-agent model unification — change all sub-agent models to the current model (Feb 20, 6:11 PM)\n**#S43** Unify all sub-agent models to current model — completed with zai/glm-4.7 (Feb 20, 6:12 PM)\n| #238 | 6:13 PM | ✅ | Sub-Agent Model Unification Request | ~213 |  |\n**#239** \" 🔵 **No Gemini Model References Found in openclaw.json**\nAs part of the effort to change all sub-agent models to the current model, the primary session searched openclaw.json for any Gemini model references. The result was negative — no Gemini references exist in that file. This narrows down where sub-agent model configurations may be defined, suggesting either a different config file contains the model specs, or the models in use are not Gemini-based in that particular config.\nA workspace-wide search for Gemini references revealed that the openclaw project is deeply integrated with Google's Gemini provider. The install script explicitly configures the Gemini provider. Past memory sessions (#S15, #S16) document successful Gemini 3 Pro sub-agent invocations. The user's rules file (USER.md) mandates model transparency when switching from Flash to Pro. This context is critical for the sub-agent model unification task — the sub-agents are Gemini-based, and the configuration for model selection likely lives outside openclaw.json, possibly in agent-specific config files or environment setup.\nWhile investigating sub-agent model configurations, the primary session listed a directory containing jobs.json — a strong candidate for where sub-agent job definitions and model assignments are stored. The presence of an equally-sized .bak file created at the same moment indicates a backup was made during a recent write operation (Feb 20 18:12), which aligns with the active session timestamp. The runs/ directory likely contains execution logs or artifacts from past sub-agent runs. This directory is the focal point for the model unification task.\n**#242** \" 🔵 **jobs.json Reveals Sub-Agent Jobs Failing Due to zai/GLM Model Errors**\nReading jobs.json exposed the root cause of the sub-agent failures: the jobs are configured to use the zai provider's GLM models (zai/glm-5 and zai/glm-4.7-flash), both of which are currently rate-limited and unavailable. This directly motivates the user's request to \"change all sub-agent models to the current model\" — the intent is to replace these failing zai/GLM model references with the currently working Gemini model. The jobs.json file is the primary target for the model update. No model fields are explicitly visible in jobs.json itself (jobs use agentId: \"main\"), suggesting the model configuration may be stored in the agent definition rather than per-job, or in a separate config file referenced by the openclaw system.\n**#243** \" 🔵 **openclaw.json Backup Files Contain zai/glm-5 Model Definitions**\nThis search reveals the true location of model configuration: openclaw.json (not jobs.json). The backup chain (bak through bak.3) shows a history of edits to this file, all of which previously contained zai/glm-5. Since the live openclaw.json was not returned in the search results, the current file has likely already been updated as part of the model unification task. The shell completion scripts also reveal that openclaw supports a broad range of providers, confirming the flexibility of the system's model configuration.\n**#S44** Audit and change all sub-agent models to the current active model (zai/glm-4.7) (Feb 20, 6:16 PM)\n**Investigated**: Active configuration file openclaw.json was examined, along with cron job configurations, extensions, and backup files. workspace/USER.md and workspace/MEMORY.md were also reviewed for stale model references.\n**Learned**: All active sub-agent configurations already use zai/glm-4.7 as both primary and fallback. Cron jobs use sessionTarget: \"isolated\" and inherit from openclaw.json defaults. Extensions have no separate model overrides. Backup files contain old glm-5 references but are not active. References to \"Gemini 3 Pro\" in USER.md are documentation examples, not live settings.\n**Completed**: No changes were required — all active sub-agent models were already set to zai/glm-4.7. The audit confirmed consistency across cron jobs, extensions, and the primary openclaw.json config.\n**Next Steps**: Awaiting user decision on whether a Gateway daemon restart is needed. No further model changes are planned unless the user identifies additional configurations to update."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6,"aggregated":"| #65 | 10:21 PM | 🔵 | OpenClaw 설정 파일 구조 확인 (openclaw.json) | ~241 |  |\n**../../home/lfant/.openclaw/extensions/claude-mem/.env (또는 유사 설정 파일)**\n| #66 | \" | 🔵 | claude-mem 환경변수 설정 전체 확인 | ~243 |  |\n**#S40** Change all sub-agent models to the current model (Feb 19, 8:23 AM)\n| #235 | 6:11 PM | ✅ | Sub-agent Model Unification Request | ~195 |  |\n**#S41** Sub-agent model unification — change all sub-agent models to the current model (Feb 20, 6:11 PM)\n**#S43** Unify all sub-agent models to current model — completed with zai/glm-4.7 (Feb 20, 6:12 PM)\n| #238 | 6:13 PM | ✅ | Sub-Agent Model Unification Request | ~213 |  |\n**#239** \" 🔵 **No Gemini Model References Found in openclaw.json**\nAs part of the effort to change all sub-agent models to the current model, the primary session searched openclaw.json for any Gemini model references. Th