y/configuration.md:- 设为 `commands.native: true|false` 强制全部开启或关闭，或按渠道覆盖 `channels.discord.commands.native`、`channels.telegram.commands.native`、`channels.slack.commands.native`（bool 或 `\"auto\"`）。`false` 在启动时清除 Discord/Telegram 上先前注册的命令；Slack 命令在 Slack 应用中管理。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/tools/slash-commands.md:- `commands.native`（默认 `\"auto\"`）注册原生命令。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/tools/slash-commands.md:  - 设置 `channels.discord.commands.native`、`channels.telegram.commands.native` 或 `channels.slack.commands.native` 以按提供商覆盖（布尔值或 `\"auto\"`）。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/tools/slash-commands.md:- `commands.nativeSkills`（默认 `\"auto\"`）在支持时原生注册 **Skill** 命令。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/tools/slash-commands.md:  - 设置 `channels.discord.commands.nativeSkills`、`channels.telegram.commands.nativeSkills` 或 `channels.slack.commands.nativeSkills` 以按提供商覆盖（布尔值或 `\"auto\"`）。","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771579119260}}
