{"type":"message","id":"9e5f506c","parentId":"20527a83","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:23:02.699Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"현재 설정에는 zai provider만 있고, Gemini provider는 없습니다. Gemini 3.1 Pro를 사용하려면:\n\n1. Gemini provider를 추가해야 함\n2. API key 설정 필요\n3. models 리스트에 Gemini 3.1 Pro 모델 추가\n4. 코딩 작업용 alias 설정\n\nGemini 3.1 Pro는 Google의 모델이므로, Google AI Studio API key가 필요합니다.\n\n사용자가 현재 Gemini API key가 있는지, 그리고 어떻게 설정하는지 알려줘야겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"현재 설정에는 **zai provider만** 있고, Gemini는 없습니다. Gemini 3.1 Pro를 추가하려면 설정이 필요합니다.\n\n---\n\n## Gemini 3.1 Pro 설정 단계\n\n### 1. Google AI Studio API Key 발급\n\n1. [Google AI Studio](https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey) 접속\n2. API Key 생성\n\n### 2. OpenClaw에 Gemini 추가"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0ebab88d24b54c8c9d01749b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"npx openclaw setup-token --provider=gemini --help 2>&1 | head -30"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":1350,"output":379,"cacheRead":55840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57569,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771579374814}}
{"type":"message","id":"ce3af3a8","parentId":"9e5f506c","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:23:04.637Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0ebab88d24b54c8c9d01749b","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[plugins] [claude-mem] OpenClaw plugin loaded — v1.0.0 (worker: 127.0.0.1:37777)\n\n🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.19-2 (45d9b20) — iMessage green bubble energy, but for everyone.\n\nUsage: openclaw [options] [command]\n\nOptions:\n  --dev             Dev profile: isolate state under ~/.openclaw-dev, default\n                    gateway port 19001, and shift derived ports (browser/canvas)\n  -h, --help        Display help for command\n  --no-color        Disable ANSI colors\n  --profile <name>  Use a named profile (isolates\n                    OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/OPENCLAW_CONFIG_PATH under\n                    ~/.openclaw-<name>)\n  -V, --version     output the version number\n\nCommands:\n  Hint: commands suffixed with * have subcommands. Run <command> --help for details.\n  acp *             Agent Control Protocol tools\n  agent             Run one agent turn via the Gateway\n  agents *          Manage isolated agents (workspaces, auth, routing)\n  approvals *       Manage exec approvals (gateway or node host)\n  browser *         Manage OpenClaw's dedicated browser (Chrome/Chromium)\n  channels *        Manage connected chat channels (Telegram, Discord, etc.)\n  clawbot *         Legacy clawbot command aliases\n  completion        Generate shell completion script\n  config *          Non-interactive config helpers (get/set/unset). Default:\n                    starts setup wizard.\n  configure         Interactive setup wizard for credentials, channels, gateway,\n                    and agent defaults"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1928,"aggregated":"[plugins] [claude-mem] OpenClaw plugin loaded — v1.0.0 (worker: 127.0.0.1:37777)\n\n🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.19-2 (45d9b20) — iMessage green bubble energy, but for everyone.\n\nUsage: openclaw [options] [command]\n\nOptions:\n  --dev             Dev profile: isolate state under ~/.openclaw-dev, default\n                    gateway port 19001, and shift derived ports (browser/canvas)\n  -h, --help        Display help for command\n  --no-color        Disable ANSI colors\n  --profile <name>  Use a named profile (isolates\n                    OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/OPENCLAW_CONFIG_PATH under\n                    ~/.openclaw-<name>)\n  -V, --version     output the version number\n\nCommands:\n  Hint: commands suffixed with * have subcommands. Run <command> --help for details.\n  acp *             Agent Control Protocol tools\n  agent             Run one agent turn via the Gateway\n  agents *          Manage isolated agents (workspaces, auth, routing)\n  approvals *       Manage exec approvals (gateway or node host)\n  browser *         Manage OpenClaw's dedicated browser (Chrome/Chromium)\n  channels *        Manage connected chat channels (Telegram, Discord, etc.)\n  clawbot *         Legacy clawbot command aliases\n  completion        Generate shell completion script\n  config *          Non-interactive config helpers (get/set/unset). Default:\n                    starts setup wizard.\n  configure         Interactive setup wizard for credentials, channels, gateway,\n                    and agent defaults","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771579384632}}
