{"type":"message","id":"8d8c3b3f","parentId":"1bdb29fc","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:23:07.945Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_15cc6be378604837b4242cf1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.19-2 (45d9b20) — Give me a workspace and I'll give you fewer tabs, fewer toggles, and more oxygen.\n\nUsage: openclaw configure [options]\n\nInteractive setup wizard for credentials, channels, gateway, and agent defaults\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help           Display help for command\n  --section <section>  Configuration sections (repeatable). Options: workspace,\n                       model, web, gateway, daemon, channels, skills, health\n                       (default: [])\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/configure"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1011,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.19-2 (45d9b20) — Give me a workspace and I'll give you fewer tabs, fewer toggles, and more oxygen.\n\nUsage: openclaw configure [options]\n\nInteractive setup wizard for credentials, channels, gateway, and agent defaults\n\nOptions:\n  -h, --help           Display help for command\n  --section <section>  Configuration sections (repeatable). Options: workspace,\n                       model, web, gateway, daemon, channels, skills, health\n                       (default: [])\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/configure","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771579387940}}
{"type":"message","id":"adf5dbca","parentId":"8d8c3b3f","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:23:15.201Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"interactive wizard를 사용하거나, config 명령어로 직접 설정할 수 있습니다. config로 직접 설정하는 방법을 안내해 드리겠습니다.\n\nGemini provider를 추가하려면:\n1. auth.profiles에 gemini 추가\n2. models.providers에 gemini 추가\n3. models에 gemini-3.1-pro 등 추가","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"직접 설정하려면 다음과 같이 하면 됩니다. **API Key를 알려주시면 설정해 드릴게요** (보안상 직접 입력하시는 것을 추천합니다):\n\n```bash\nnpx openclaw config set auth.profiles.gemini:default.provider gemini\nnpx openclaw config set auth.profiles.gemini:default.mode api_key\nnpx openclaw config set auth.profiles.gemini:default.apiKey \"YOUR_API_KEY\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 완성된 설정 예시\n\n```json\n{\n  \"auth\": {\n    \"profiles\": {\n      \"zai:default\": { \"provider\": \"zai\", \"mode\": \"api_key\" },\n      \"gemini:default\": { \"provider\": \"gemini\", \"mode\": \"api_key\", \"apiKey\": \"...\" }\n    }\n  },\n  \"models\": {\n    \"providers\": {\n      \"gemini\": {\n        \"baseUrl\": \"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta\",\n        \"api\": \"openai-completions\",\n        \"models\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"gemini-3.1-pro\",\n            \"name\": \"Gemini 3.1 Pro\",\n            \"reasoning\": true,\n            \"input\": [\"text\"],\n            \"cost\": { \"input\": 0, \"output\": 0 },\n            \"contextWindow\": 2000000,\n            \"maxTokens\": 8192\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"defaults\": {\n      \"model\": {\n        \"primary\": \"gemini/gemini-3.1-pro\",\n        \"fallbacks\": [\"zai/glm-4.7\"]\n      },\n      \"models\": {\n        \"gemini/gemini-3.1-pro\": { \"alias\": \"Code\" },\n        \"zai/glm-4.7\": { \"alias\": \"GLM\" }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 질문\n\n1. **Gemini API Key를 이미 가지고 계신가요?**\n2. **코딩 전용으로 쓰시겠어요, 아니면 일반용도도 쓰시겠어요?**\n\nAPI Key를 가지고 계시면 직접 입력하시는 것이 안전합니다. 저가 대신 설정해 드려도 되지만, 민감 정보라 직접 하는 것을 권장합니다."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":135,"output":706,"cacheRead":57845,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58686,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771579387945}}
