{"type":"message","id":"22022502","parentId":"6ffd92f0","timestamp":"2026-02-20T09:24:50.507Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Go도 설치되어 있지 않습니다. 다른 방법으로 설치해야 합니다.\n\nGitHub에서 직접 바이너리를 다운로드하거나, 다른 방법을 찾아야 합니다.\n\ngog의 GitHub repository를 확인해보겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4d03d1f2898f41f0971d5157","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s https://api.github.com/repos/steipete/gog/releases/latest | grep -E '\"tag_name\"|\"browser_download_url\"' | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":14,"output":174,"cacheRead":59328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59516,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771579487271}}
