ications or tasks from memory. Keep it sharp and helpful.\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771624800000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1771572865897,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 28545,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1,\n        \"lastError\": \"Error: All models failed (2): zai/glm-5: ⚠️ API rate limit reached. Please try again later. (rate_limit) | zai/glm-4.7-flash: No available auth profile for zai (all in cooldown or unavailable). (rate_limit)\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9fbab8e2-08fa-4e76-aa00-93296c5dfd89\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"name\": \"notion-daily-briefing\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"notify\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1771342778984,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1771572894496,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 8 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Seoul\"\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"message\": \"Run the python script `/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/notion_daily_brief.py` to fetch the latest Notion tasks from yesterday 07:00 to today 07:00. Present the results clearly to Sam in your normal assistant voice (Antigravity 🌌).\",\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1771628400000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1771572894444,\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 52,\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 1,\n        \"lastError\": \"Error: All models failed (2): zai/glm-5: No available auth profile for zai (all in cooldown or unavailable). (rate_limit) | zai/glm-4.7-flash: Provider zai is in cooldown (all profiles unavailable) (rate_limit)\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"52ed00fd-cb4e-41ec-bde8-8c03c61c3d93\",\n      \"agentId\": \"mai