{"type":"message","id":"749cb89b","parentId":"1c49eaf6","timestamp":"2026-02-20T13:25:25.489Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"사용자가 전체 크론을 다시 실행해달라고 요청했습니다. \n\n현재 설정 상태:\n- dmPolicy: \"pairing\" (방금 변경한 상태)\n- Gateway: running (오후 10:09에 재시작됨)\n\n각 크론 작업을 실행해야 합니다:\n1. daily-security-audit\n2. daily-update-check\n3. perioding-memory-maintenance\n4. daily-morning-briefing\n5. notion-daily-briefing\n6. daily-github-backup\n\n각각 sessions_spawn으로 실행하거나, 또는 개별 메시지를 통해 각 크론 명령을 실행해야 합니다.\n\n각 크론을 실행하고 결과를 요약하겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"앗겠습니다. 각 크론을 실행하겠습니다:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c0044007ea0f4c46be09245f","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"Run daily security audit: Execute 'openclaw security audit --deep'. If any critical issues are found, alert Sam immediately. Otherwise, provide a brief summary of system health.","cleanup":"delete"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":76711,"output":406,"cacheRead":13230,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90347,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771593910032}}
