{"type":"message","id":"2e720d78","parentId":"5e2b3fce","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:54:48.860Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"사용자가 /kill 명령을 입력했습니다. 이 명령은 실행 중인 프로세스를 종료하는 명령입니다.\n\n현재 실행 중인 서브에이전트나 프로세스가 있는지 확인해야 합니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3fbe9029ffd04cbdad281c1b","name":"subagents","arguments":{"action":"list"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":91307,"output":120,"cacheRead":2994,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94421,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771599263981}}
{"type":"message","id":"a8381336","parentId":"2e720d78","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:54:48.877Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3fbe9029ffd04cbdad281c1b","toolName":"subagents","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"action\": \"list\",\n  \"requesterSessionKey\": \"agent:main:main\",\n  \"callerSessionKey\": \"agent:main:main\",\n  \"callerIsSubagent\": false,\n  \"total\": 0,\n  \"active\": [],\n  \"recent\": [],\n  \"text\": \"active subagents:\\n(none)\\n\\nrecent (last 30m):\\n(none)\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"ok","action":"list","requesterSessionKey":"agent:main:main","callerSessionKey":"agent:main:main","callerIsSubagent":false,"total":0,"active":[],"recent":[],"text":"active subagents:\n(none)\n\nrecent (last 30m):\n(none)"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771599288870}}
{"type":"message","id":"a1b50125","parentId":"a8381336","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:56:25.558Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"현재 실행 중인 서브에이전트가 없습니다. /kill 명령을 사용하여 아무것도 종료되지 않을 것입니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"현재 **실행 중인 서브에이전트가 없습니다.**\n\n`/kill` 명령은 실행 중인 서브에이전트를 종료하는 명령입니다. 지금은 종료할 대상이 없습니다.\n\n---\n\n## 📋 도움말이 필요하신가요?\n\n다음 중 하나라도 도와드릴까요?\n\n1. **크론 작업 전부 실행** - 아직 테스트만 진행함\n2. **pairing 상태 확인** - 브라우저에서 Dashboard 접속\n3. **시스템 상태 전체 점검** - Gateway, 모델, 채널 등\n4. **보안 이슈 검토** - claude-mem 플러그인 확인\n5. **Notion 최근 메일** - gog 설정 완료 후\n6. **Gmail 직접 접속** - 브라우저로 열기\n7. **기타 요청**\n\n어떤 것을 도와드릴까요? 🙏"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":101,"output":317,"cacheRead":94366,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94784,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771599288877}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e3b8d3a","parentId":"a1b50125","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:56:25.725Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"28989d7c-b8e0-4e36-a775-8715808a4146\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Fri 2026-02-20 23:55 GMT+9] 텔레그램에서 메세지 또 안보여 왜그러는지 확인해줘"}],"timestamp":1771599385721}}
{"type":"message","id":"b011a61f","parentId":"6e3b8d3a","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:56:38.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is experiencing a situation where they can see messages on Telegram (sent via OpenClaw gateway), but when they send commands like \"/skill\", they don't see any response from me. They're asking me to check why messages aren't showing up.\n\nLooking at the session history:\n1. The user had been asking about various configuration issues\n2. I made some changes to openclaw.json (dmPolicy, nativeSkills, etc.)\n3. Gateway restarts were attempted\n4. The user mentioned earlier that pairing mode isn't showing correctly on Telegram\n\nThe issue is likely:\n- Commands from the user are being received by the gateway\n- But my responses might not be getting delivered back to Telegram\n- This could be due to the announce delivery issues we saw earlier\n\nLet me check the recent logs more carefully to understand what's happening.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"로그를 자세히 확인해 보겠습니다:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f94ec8d5e904fcd84305f9d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -100 /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-02-20.log 2>&1 | grep -i \"5487758242\\|openclaw-control-ui\\|webchat\\|telegram\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":92031,"output":415,"cacheRead":3011,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95457,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771599385724}}
