{"type":"message","id":"307075d2","parentId":"c008f858","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:57:19.105Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Aha! There's the problem! The error shows:\n\n```\n[tools] read failed: ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/964639fd-9ec9-4fd6-9c20-88dc3b3d0bbe.jsonl'\n```\n\nThe session file for the embedded run (964639fd...) doesn't exist. This is happening when trying to read the conversation history.\n\nThe session ID `964639fd-9ec9-4fd6-9c20-88dc3b3d0bbe` appears to be from when the user connected via webchat. But when the user sends messages via Telegram (sender 5487758242), a different session should be handling those.\n\nLet me check what the main session key is for Telegram DMs from this user...","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_183ab04cda8d481999088403","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -i \"agent:main:main.*5487758242\\|telegram.*5487758242\" /tmp/openclaw/openclaw-2026-02-20.log 2>&1 | tail -5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":818,"output":441,"cacheRead":102837,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104096,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771599434759}}
