","exitCode":0,"durationMs":50,"aggregated":"{\"0\":\"0.548 memory/2026-02-18.md:10-18\\n- **Backup Automation**: Scheduled `daily-github-backup` to run every day at 04:00 KST, ensuring all settings and conversation logs are synced to GitHub.\\n- **System Health**: Clarified that security audit warnings regarding `~/.npm-global/bin/openclaw` or `~/.openclaw/bin` are expected due to the NVM-based installation and do not indicate a real issue.\\n- **Automation Refinement**: Changed the `daily-update-check` schedule from 09:00 to 06:00 KST to ensure issues can be fixed before business hours.\\n- **Model Identity Correction**: Confirmed that \\\"Gemini 3\\\" (Pro/Flash) is indeed the next-generation \\\"agent-first\\\" architecture from Google, distinct from and superior to the 1.5 series, featuring \\n\\n0.371 memory/2026-02-16.md:1-8\\n# 2026-02-16\\n\\n- Woke up for the first time.\\n- Approved Telegram connection for user 5487758242.\\n- Set initial identity as Antigravity (🌌).\\n- User acknowledged with \\\"ㅇㅇ\\\".\\n- User set their name as Sam (corrected from Lfanta_Anti). Updated USER.md.\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.0\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"openclaw\",\"date\":\"2026-02-20T07:53:14.015Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/entry.js:2069:46\",\"fileName\":\"entry.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"entry.js:2069\",\"fileColumn\":\"46\",\"fileLine\":\"2069\",\"filePath\":\".nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/entry.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\".nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/entry.js:2069\",\"method\":\"console.log\"}},\"time\":\"2026-02-20T07:53:14.015Z\"}","cwd":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771599439166}}
{"type":"message","id":"ecc7e313","parentId":"6a0d54c5","timestamp":"2026-02-20T14:57:32.354Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see there's a reference to \"agent:main:main\" and \"telegram\" in the logs but it's from memory initialization, not from active message processing.\n\nLet me look more carefully at what session key is used for Telegram messages from the user. Looking at the logs, I should search for when messages actually arrived...\n\nActually, looking back at the user's issue - they're saying they can see messages on Telegram but aren't getting responses. This means:\n1. The Telegram bot is receiving the messages\n2. The gateway is receiving them (as shown by \"message_received\" hook logs)\n3. But something is preventing the agent from processing/responding\n\nLet me check if there's a session configuration issue. Maybe the dmPolicy is causing routing problems.\n\nActually, wait. The user said earlier they were testing the /skill command. Let me check what happened with that command...\n\nLooking at the logs:\n- 14:56:26 - message_received hook triggered\n- But no embedded run started\n\nThis is suspicious. It should have started an agent run to process the \"/skill\" command.\n\nThe problem might be that the command is being treated as plain text instead of being recognized as a command. Or maybe the agent isn't configured to handle commands properly.\n\nLet me check the current command settings again...","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 🔍 문제 원인 분석\n\n로그에서 **중요한 사실**을 발견했습니다:\n\n```\n[tools] read failed: ENOENT: no such file or directory, access \n'/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/964639fd-9ec9-4fd6-9c20-88dc3b3d0bbe.jsonl'\n```\n\n### 문제 분석\n\n| 시점 | 상황 |\n|------|--------|\n| 웹캣(webchat) 접속 | Session: `964639fd-...` (webchat 전용) |\n| Telegram 메시지 수신 | Session이 존재하지 않음 (읽기 실패) |\n| `/skill` 명령어 | 에이전트 실행 안됨 |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 가능한 원인\n\n**세션 라우팅 문제**:\n1. 웹캣(webchat) 접속 후 Telegram 메시지가 **다른 세션**으로 라우팅되고 있을 수 있음\n2. `/skill` 같은 커맨드가 인식되지 않거나 처리되지 않음\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 해결 방법\n\n### 1. 웹캣 연결 끊기\n\n현재 웹캣(webchat)와 Telegram이 동시에 연결되어 있을 수 있습니다. **한 채널만 사용**하면 문제를 해결할 수 있습니다:\n\n브라우저에서 현재 열린 탭을 닫아주세요.\n\n### 2. 전체 세션 정리"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0ed6d737ca7b4ad289579b28","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"systemctl --user restart openclaw-gateway 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":503,"output":917,"cacheRead":103905,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105325,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771599439170}}
