{"type":"message","id":"6c9d023e","parentId":"0e1034a2","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:17:46.191Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to check if there's a way to use OAuth mode with openclaw. They want me to investigate/explain this.\n\nLet me analyze the current configuration and see what OAuth capabilities are available.\n\nLooking at the current config, I can see:\n- `channels.telegram.dmPolicy` is \"pairing\"\n- `channels.telegram.heartbeat` has settings like `showOk`, `showAlerts`, `useIndicator`\n\nThe user is asking if there's a way to use OAuth mode with openclaw - possibly they want to understand the authentication/authorization options available.\n\nLet me check the docs for OAuth/pairing options in OpenClaw.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"로그를 확인해 보겠습니다. OpenClaw에서 **OAuth/pairing 옵션**을 확인하겠습니다:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_03ce66a97230436ba9c2db9a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -ri \"oauth\\|pairing\\|auth.*mode\" ~/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs --include=\"*.md\" | grep -i \"telegram\\|dmPolicy\" | head -30"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":113138,"output":362,"cacheRead":3064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116564,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771600590787}}
{"type":"message","id":"6452bd02","parentId":"6c9d023e","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:17:46.242Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_03ce66a97230436ba9c2db9a","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:If more than one person can DM your bot (multiple entries in `allowFrom`, pairing approvals for multiple people, or `dmPolicy: \"open\"`), enable **secure DM mode** so DMs from different senders don’t share one context by default:\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration.md:          dmPolicy: \"pairing\",   // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:    whatsapp: { dmPolicy: \"pairing\", groups: { \"*\": { requireMention: true } } },\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:- Keep `dmPolicy: \"pairing\"` or strict allowlists.\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:  - When `dmPolicy=\"pairing\"`, approvals are written to `~/.openclaw/credentials/<channel>-allowFrom.json` (merged with config allowlists).\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:  - **Security note:** treat `dmPolicy=\"open\"` and `groupPolicy=\"open\"` as last-resort settings. They should be barely used; prefer pairing + allowlists unless you fully trust every member of the room.\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:  channels: { whatsapp: { dmPolicy: \"pairing\" } },\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/concepts/multi-agent.md:          dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:如果为空且 `channels.whatsapp.dmPolicy=\"pairing\"`，未知发送者将收到配对码。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:- 默认私聊：`channels.mattermost.dmPolicy=\"pairing\"`（未知发送者收到配对码）。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/security/index.md:  - 当 `dmPolicy=\"pairing\"` 时，批准会写入 `~/.openclaw/credentials/<channel>-allowFrom.json`（与配置白名单合并）。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/security/index.md:  channels: { whatsapp: { dmPolicy: \"pairing\" } },\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/security/index.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/troubleshooting.md:如果 `dmPolicy` 是 `pairing`，未知发送者应该收到一个代码，他们的消息在批准前会被忽略。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/platforms/digitalocean.md:openclaw pairing list telegram\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/platforms/digitalocean.md:openclaw pairing approve telegram <CODE>\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/channels/nostr.md:| `dmPolicy`   | string   | `pairing`                                   | 私信访问策略                |"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":40,"aggregated":"/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-examples.md:If more than one person can DM your bot (multiple entries in `allowFrom`, pairing approvals for multiple people, or `dmPolicy: \"open\"`), enable **secure DM mode** so DMs from different senders don’t share one context by default:\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration-reference.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/configuration.md:          dmPolicy: \"pairing\",   // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:    whatsapp: { dmPolicy: \"pairing\", groups: { \"*\": { requireMention: true } } },\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:- Keep `dmPolicy: \"pairing\"` or strict allowlists.\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:  - When `dmPolicy=\"pairing\"`, approvals are written to `~/.openclaw/credentials/<channel>-allowFrom.json` (merged with config allowlists).\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:  - **Security note:** treat `dmPolicy=\"open\"` and `groupPolicy=\"open\"` as last-resort settings. They should be barely used; prefer pairing + allowlists unless you fully trust every member of the room.\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:  channels: { whatsapp: { dmPolicy: \"pairing\" } },\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/gateway/security/index.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/concepts/multi-agent.md:          dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration-examples.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:如果为空且 `channels.whatsapp.dmPolicy=\"pairing\"`，未知发送者将收到配对码。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:- 默认私聊：`channels.mattermost.dmPolicy=\"pairing\"`（未知发送者收到配对码）。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/configuration.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\", // pairing | allowlist | open | disabled\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/security/index.md:  - 当 `dmPolicy=\"pairing\"` 时，批准会写入 `~/.openclaw/credentials/<channel>-allowFrom.json`（与配置白名单合并）。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/security/index.md:  channels: { whatsapp: { dmPolicy: \"pairing\" } },\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/security/index.md:      dmPolicy: \"pairing\",\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/gateway/troubleshooting.md:如果 `dmPolicy` 是 `pairing`，未知发送者应该收到一个代码，他们的消息在批准前会被忽略。\n/home/lfant/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/platforms/digitalocean.md