{"type":"message","id":"2283e579","parentId":"468f1b35","timestamp":"2026-02-20T16:02:45.419Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking \"poem 을 말하는거야\" (What does poem mean?)\n\nLet me think about what \"poem\" could refer to in the context of our conversation:\n\n1. We've been discussing OpenClaw configuration\n2. We've been talking about models, subagents, fallbacks\n3. The user might be confused about a command or term I used\n\nWait, I think the user might be asking about something I said or displayed. Let me think...\n\nActually, looking back at the conversation, I don't see where I used the word \"poem\" specifically. However, I did display a lot of status information and configurations.\n\nThe user is asking \"What does poem mean?\" in Korean.\n\nCould this be:\n1. A typo or confusion on the user's part?\n2. A word they saw in the UI?\n3. Something related to the status card or configuration?\n\nLet me check if \"poem\" appears in any of the status outputs or configs I showed...\n\nActually, I think this might be related to the session status card or some UI element they're seeing. But I don't have visibility into what they're seeing beyond what they tell me.\n\nI should ask for clarification about what \"poem\" they're referring to, since I haven't used that term.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\"poem\"이라는 용어는 제가 사용한 적이 없어요. 🤔\n\n혹시 **UI 화면이나 로그**에 \"poem\"이 표시되어 있나요?\n\n현재까지 확인해 드린 내용 중에서 이 용어가 나오지 않습니다:\n\n- 모델 설정\n- 서브에이전트\n- 페어링 설정\n- 크론 작업\n- 시스템 시간\n\n**어떤 화면에서 \"poem\"이라고 표시**되고 있는지 알려주시면 확인해 드리겠습니다. 🙏"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":104992,"output":686,"cacheRead":13202,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118880,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771603344102}}
