:"call_oFOMcYyUNn6CbcNWGpBOTaZK|fc_048b45c3663fe2170169988dfd174c8191b6941f1198911ab2","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md","oldText":"Use this routing policy by default:\n\n- **Main session:** fast/default work on **GLM-4.7**\n- **Sub-agent:** complex reasoning/coding work on **Codex (gpt-5.3-codex, thinking=high)**\n\n### When to escalate to a sub-agent (Codex)\n\nEscalate when one or more apply:\n\n1. Multi-step reasoning with dependencies (plan → verify → revise)\n2. Code changes across multiple files/modules\n3. Deep debugging / root-cause analysis with hypothesis testing\n4. Security/compliance trade-off decisions (blast radius, risk analysis)\n5. Long-running research/synthesis tasks likely to block main conversation\n\n### When to stay in main session (GLM)\n\nStay in main when tasks are:\n\n- quick Q&A or summaries\n- simple rewrites/formatting\n- one-shot checks with low ambiguity\n- low-risk operational confirmations\n\n### Execution default\n\n- Prefer spawning sub-agents for complex tasks.\n- Sub-agent defaults are configured to Codex + high thinking.\n- If needed, override per run explicitly with `sessions_spawn.model`.\n","newText":"Use this routing policy by default (**aggressive sub-agent mode**):\n\n- **Main session:** very short/low-risk tasks on **GLM-4.7**\n- **Sub-agent:** most non-trivial reasoning/coding work on **Codex (gpt-5.3-codex, thinking=high)**\n\n### When to escalate to a sub-agent (Codex)\n\nEscalate when **any one** applies (lower threshold):\n\n1. Task needs 2+ steps (plan → execute, compare options, verify output)\n2. Any code change beyond a one-liner\n3. Any debugging where root cause is not obvious\n4. Any decision with security/compliance/production impact\n5. Any task expected to take >2 minutes or require multiple tool calls\n6. Any request that benefits from parallel work or background execution\n\n### When to stay in main session (GLM)\n\nStay in main only when all are true:\n\n- quick one-shot answer (<5 sentences)\n- no multi-step reasoning needed\n- no codebase-wide edits/debugging\n- low-risk and immediately reversible\n\n### Execution default\n\n- **Spawn-first policy:** if uncertain, spawn a sub-agent.\n- Sub-agent defaults are Codex + high thinking.\n- For routine work, keep in main only when clearly trivial.\n- If needed, override per run with `sessions_spawn.model`.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md\",\"oldText\":\"Use this routing policy by default:\\n\\n- **Main session:** fast/default work on **GLM-4.7**\\n- **Sub-agent:** complex reasoning/coding work on **Codex (gpt-5.3-codex, thinking=high)**\\n\\n### When to escalate to a sub-agent (Codex)\\n\\nEscalate when one or more apply:\\n\\n1. Multi-step reasoning with dependencies (plan → verify → revise)\\n2. Code changes across multiple files/modules\\n3. Deep debugging / root-cause analysis with hypothesis testing\\n4. Security/compliance trade-off decisions (blast radius, risk analysis)\\n5. Long-running research/synthesis tasks likely to block main conversation\\n\\n### When to stay in main session (GLM)\\n\\nStay in main when tasks are:\\n\\n- quick Q&A or summaries\\n- simple rewrites/formatting\\n- one-shot checks with low ambiguity\\n- low-risk operational confirmations\\n\\n### Execution default\\n\\n- Prefer spawning sub-agents for complex tasks.\\n- Sub-agent defaults are configured to Codex + high thinking.\\n- If needed, override per run explicitly with `sessions_spawn.model`.\\n\",\"newText\":\"Use this routing policy by default (**aggressive sub-agent mode**):\\n\\n- **Main session:** very short/low-risk tasks on **GLM-4.7**\\n- **Sub-agent:** most non-trivial reasoning/coding work on **Codex (gpt-5.3-codex, thinking=high)**\\n\\n### When to escalate to a sub-agent (Codex)\\n\\nEscalate when **any one** applies (lower threshold):\\n\\n1. Task needs 2+ steps (plan → execute, compare options, verify output)\\n2. Any code change beyond a one-liner\\n3. Any debugging where root cause is not obvious\\n4. Any decision with security/compliance/production impact\\n5. Any task expected to take >2 minutes or require multiple tool calls\\n6. Any request that benefits from parallel work or background execution\\n\\n### When to stay in main session (GLM)\\n\\nStay in main only when all are true:\\n\\n- quick one-shot answer (<5 sentences)\\n- no multi-step reasoning needed\\n- no codebase-wide edits/debugging\\n- low-risk and immediately reversible\\n\\n### Execution default\\n\\n- **Spawn-first policy:** if uncertain, spawn a sub-agent.\\n- Sub-agent defaults are Codex + high thinking.\\n- For routine work, keep in main only when clearly trivial.\\n- If needed, override per run with `sessions_spawn.model`.\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":908,"output":695,"cacheRead":181376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":182979,"cost":{"input":0.001589,"output":0.009729999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0317408,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.043059799999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771605490085}}
